      "text": "VBryk （ます）＋かける\n\r\n- a communicative action is directed toward someone \n\n\n\r\na).　彼は彼女に話しかけた。\n\r\nHe addressed/ started talking to her.\n\n\n\r\nb).彼女は彼に笑いかけた。\n\r\nShe smiled at him",
